# Known test pairing keys of the emulator gate (AGENTS.md section 7.6, log canary). Both are 32 bytes
# of ASCII, base64url without padding: recognisable test values, never real secrets. gate.sh pairs the
# two devices with GATE_PSK (and the AC-1a stranger with GATE_PSK_OTHER); scripts/poc/canary-scan.sh
# then fails the gate if either key, a key derived from it, the room id or plaintext SDP shows up in
# any log the gate collected.
GATE_PSK=R1MtR0FURS1DQU5BUlktUFNLLUEtMDEyMzQ1Njc4OWE
GATE_PSK_OTHER=R1MtR0FURS1DQU5BUlktUFNLLUItMDEyMzQ1Njc4OWI
